  "description": "A TimeProvider-based clock for the Orion family: it IS a TimeProvider (drops into any BCL API that takes one) and IS the Orion IOrionClock, and adds the schedule/TTL vocabulary every backend keeps re-deriving - Ttl and Deadline value types with capture-at-issue semantics and deadline-driven cancellation. Deterministic under test through a controllable fake. AOT- and trim-clean.",
